  "description": "Twins with the same face, Malsuk and Seri. Malsuk worked in two shifts at the factory, contributing to her younger sister Seri's tuition. Seri lives a life of luxury, attending university during the day and earning pocket money at clubs at night. Then one day, Seri becomes deeply entangled with Hee-cheol, the boyfriend of her older sister Mal-sook, whom she met at a club...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=845646), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13498581) \n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0004372)",
